# No localhost browser verification

In this workspace, Cursor browser tools work on public sites but **do not work** against the local Next.js app (`http://localhost:*`, `http://127.0.0.1:*`). Navigating there hangs or aborts. The Events app is also behind login.

**Do not:**
- Call `browser_navigate` / other IDE browser tools to localhost
- Start a second `next dev` just to "verify in the browser"
- Retry after an abort

**Do instead:**
- Unit tests, or `curl` only if an endpoint is actually unauthenticated
- Ask the user to check the running app on port 3000 if a visual pass is needed
